    "detailed_description": "Star Overhead is a Challenging platformer with unique organ-playing mechanics that augment the flow of time.  The game follows a former military chaplain who, after the military, became a pastor. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThroughout the game, you will find snippets and journal entries about his life, his insights on a soldier's place in religion, and how faith plays a role in war and beyond. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolve intriguing time-based platforming challenges as you explore the memories of his home. Nearing the end of his life, he floats between the great beyond and things that keep him grounded.",
